OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,FThe UK government is progressing plans 
OL,8,Fthat would allow BBC iPlayer to carry  
OL,9,Fcontent from rival broadcasters, along 
OL,10,Fwith the advertising attached to it,   
OL,11,Faccording to a report by Reuters.      
OL,13,FThe news agency, citing two people with
OL,14,Fknowledge of the matter, reported on   
OL,15,F25th November 2026 that the proposals  
OL,16,Fcould lead to an overhaul of the       
OL,17,Fstreaming platform. One of the sources 
OL,18,Fsaid the technology upgrade required   
OL,19,Fcould cost tens of millions of pounds. 
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
