OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,FOne of the sources said the upgrade    
OL,8,Fcould be paid for by the BBC's         
OL,9,Fcommercial arm, with the cost recovered
OL,10,Fover time through fees charged to other
OL,11,Fcontent providers.                     
OL,13,FReuters' sources said the changes would
OL,14,Falso allow UKTV, the BBC's commercial  
OL,15,Fbroadcaster, to bring content from     
OL,16,Fchannels such as U&Drama and U&Dave    
OL,17,Fonto iPlayer. One added that other     
OL,18,Fbroadcasters, including ITV, could     
OL,19,Feventually take part.                  
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
