OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,FChannel 4 is named as one potential    
OL,8,Fpartner. Reuters said the BBC referred 
OL,9,Fto comments made in July by Director   
OL,10,FGeneral Matt Brittin, who suggested    
OL,11,FChannel 4 could have content on iPlayer
OL,12,Fin partnership with the BBC while      
OL,13,Fremaining funded by advertising.       
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
