OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,FOne source told Reuters the plans could
OL,8,Falso open the way for the BBC to place 
OL,9,Fadvertising around some of its own     
OL,10,Fcontent, which is not permitted under  
OL,11,Fthe current Charter. The government    
OL,12,Fsaid last year that allowing           
OL,13,Fadvertising around older iPlayer       
OL,14,Fcontent was among the options being    
OL,15,Fconsidered.                            
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
