OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,FAccording to Reuters, the changes are  
OL,8,Fexpected to be included in the         
OL,9,Fgovernment's White Paper on the renewal
OL,10,Fof the BBC Charter. Due by the end of  
OL,11,Fthe year, it will set out the          
OL,12,Fgovernment's position on the BBC's     
OL,13,Ffunding, governance and remit from     
OL,14,F2028.                                  
OL,16,FReuters noted that the plans recall    
OL,17,FProject Kangaroo, a joint streaming    
OL,18,Fservice proposed by the BBC, ITV and   
OL,19,FChannel 4, which UK regulators blocked 
OL,20,Fin 2009.                               
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
