OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,GRESPONSES                              
OL,9,FThe Department for Culture, Media and  
OL,10,FSport told Reuters it supported public 
OL,11,Fservice broadcasters in exploring      
OL,12,Fpartnerships, and that while a range of
OL,13,Foptions for BBC funding was being      
OL,14,Fconsidered, "no final decisions have   
OL,15,Fbeen made".                            
OL,17,FIn a statement reported by Reuters, a  
OL,18,FBBC spokesperson said greater          
OL,19,Fcollaboration between public service   
OL,20,Fbroadcasters was vital to the          
OL,21,Findustry's success in a competitive    
OL,22,Fglobal market.                         
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
