OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 143 Thu 26 NovC04:11/29
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G7/7 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCGovernment advancing plans to open
OL,4,CBBC iPlayer to rival broadcasters and  
OL,5,Cadvertising, Reuters reports           
OL,7,FChannel 4 Chief Executive Priya Dogra  
OL,8,Ftold MPs this month that the iPlayer   
OL,9,Fidea was worth exploring, but that     
OL,10,Fdetails, including how advertising     
OL,11,Fwould work, still needed to be         
OL,12,Fresolved.                              
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
